    <string name="support_format">Support PDF,, Epub, Mobi, Xps, Djvu, Fb2, Cbz, Image, (Docx, PPTX), Tiff, BigTiff</string>
    <string name="about_content">Most Android PDF readers on the market are developed based on the traditional View system, while similar products built with Jetpack Compose have always been non-existent.\n\nWe have created this cross-platform PDF reader based on Compose, aiming to achieve a consistent and smooth reading experience across all platforms:\n\nCore Experience: The Android version has implemented extremely smooth zooming and scrolling functions, with decoding response far exceeding traditional solutions;\n\nPersonalization Support: Epub/Mobi, Custom fonts are supported (place TTF/OTF format fonts in the /sdcard/fonts/ path);\n\nCross-platform Progress:\nAndroid: Core reading functions have been launched;\nDesktop: The macOS version has been completed.\niOS: Requires mupdf compilation and a corresponding iOS developer account;\nDevelopment Notes: Contributions are welcome → https://github.com/archko/kreader.git\n</string>
